Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>:</b> <b>Bone</b> can be used to craft primitive weapons, and is often used to make accessories.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000000005</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">cp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Copper Piece</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">0.05 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a></b>, Turn in <b>10</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PieceOfDarkestChocolate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>None\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Skull_Head.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Skull_Head.png/420px-Skull_Head.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"325\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Skull_Head.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>It's a skull. It's looking at you. It wants to be thrown. At your friends.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Skull_Head_shown.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Skull_Head_shown.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"191\" height=\"191\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<p>Gives players within the impact area big skulls on their heads for 13 minutes - Buff: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Skull_Head_buff.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Skull_Head_buff.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Additional notes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Stack size: 100</li>\n<li>Shows UMD Difficulty: 23, but does not actually require UMD.</li>\n<li>Skull Heads do not work on anyone who has a Cosmetic Helmet, Goggles, or other cosmetic headwear equipped.</li>\n<li>Use <a href=\"/page/Potion_of_the_Party_Pooper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Potion of the Party Pooper\">Potion of the Party Pooper</a> to remove the buff.</li>\n<li>Can be bought in <a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a>:</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Skull_Grenade_store.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Skull_Grenade_store.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"520\" height=\"165\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817010734\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2915/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21076/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5276/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive p